gyp"}},{"message.content":"没权限，有管理台权限的人在“权限管理”的“AI助手权限”里加一下就可以 理仕和安柔好像可以加","message.content_type":"rich_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-22T13:05:49.139Z","message.seq":1285,"resources":[{"created_at":"2026-10-22T13:05:49.139Z","file_extension":".png","kind":"image","name":"image_1792674302091_htmc2f.png","preview_url":"https://saas.api.saas-api.org/api/oa/v1/file/fl09TqR8RUxIe3JV0VYmcgCntgtzw","size":62253,"url":"https://saas.api.saas-api.org/api/oa/v1/file/fl09TqR8RUxIe3JV0VYmcgCntgtzw"}],"sender":{"id":"ouvgomnvjyywac"}},{"message.content":"超管才有权限开的","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-23T01:41:10.173Z","message.seq":1288,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlus1pb5id"}},{"message.content":"@hearts2hearts 目前在工具层做了限制只查群聊相关的，如果需要到单聊也可以放开","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-23T02:47:54.917Z","message.seq":1298,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxoaugyp"}},{"message.content":"OK，那现在就是检索时不默认检索私聊，明确指定时才可以","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-24T02:46:35.83Z","message.seq":1343,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxoaugyp"}},{"message.content":"除了“写入”，问答和定时任务的体验问题没剩几个了，模型和检索的问题（准确率、召回率）我们反正持续在优化，对客后也会持续优化","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-27T07:01:19.864Z","message.seq":1378,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"没有权限的人，点了也不会给看。缩略图一样可以","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-27T07:33:40.522Z","message.seq":1406,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4mpnbncczdy"}},{"message.content":"有权限的人怎么都能操作","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-27T07:33:41.712Z","message.seq":1407,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4mwtykysmzj"}},{"message.content":"就给有权限的人有分享能力就行了","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-27T07:36:09.021Z","message.seq":1411,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4mwtykysmzj"}},{"message.content":"流程在审批发布中，发布完回归后可以试用","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-27T08:49:19.164Z","message.seq":1415,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvgomnvjyywac"}},{"message.content":"模型没生成tenant_id导致检索不到","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-28T11:57:59.992Z","message.seq":1513,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxoaugyp"}},{"message.content":"发布到 pre 了","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-28T12:05:43.577Z","message.seq":1518,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxoaugyp"}},{"message.content":"@可大力这个是模型在检索人员时把括号给去了，导致检索不到，另外后面一轮拒答这块是gpt模型通病，这块我统一优化一下","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-29T02:20:26.57Z","message.seq":1524,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxoaugyp"}},{"message.content":"确实没法儿靠我们几个手动零零散散测试，交互设计问题我们抓，检索的问题还是得靠自动化批量测","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-29T02:52:44.012Z","message.seq":1536,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"@hearts2hearts 比较复杂的一个原因
1. 模型本身已经检索到聊天转语音的需求，但是没有关联起来
2. 二是图里那个消息，他只是一张图，没有文字，我们还没做多模态的向量化，agent 没法直接检索到。","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-30T01:41:52.939Z","message.seq":1558,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxoaugyp"}},{"message.content":"@可大力 定时任务只在线上跑，线上那个修复还没发布呢，你可以去 pre 主动问一下","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-30T01:42:59.247Z","message.seq":1559,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxoaugyp"}},{"message.content":"@hearts2hearts 对于检索到聊天中图片数据转上下文还在做，agent 看到的只是一个链接，没有实际信息。","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_2122635335","message.send_time":"2026-10-30T02:13:16.915Z","message.seq":1561,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouv4qlvxoaugyp"}},{"message.content":"@可大力 {
